
/obj/item/paper/strelkashuttles
	name = "Notice to NEV Strelka Command staff"
	desc = "Things about the shuttle"
	info = "<center><logo><br>\
	Our vessel is one of the smallest of the fleet. So, we have fewer departement shuttles.<br>\
	The 'Decades Old shuttle' is civilian, The Javelot is a excursion shuttle, and the Hammerdart is made for security and medical.<br>\
	The Hammerdart authority falls under both the CMO and HOS.<br>\
	A mining shuttle is also present,<br>\
	as well as personal shuttles for the crew to use for duty or leisures."

/obj/item/paper/strelkacommand
	name = "Strelka Blockade Runner Mode and Ballista"
	desc = "Something about the Strelka"
	info = "<center><logo><br>\
	This is one of the oldest vessel of the fleet.<br>\
	Started off as a luxury yacht, with 3 decks, that carried NT VIPs and celebrity.<br>\
	When the corporate wars broke out, the vessel was fast enough to serve as a blockade runner.<br>\
	In this mode, all external windows are blocked off.<br>\
	The ballista and the whole 4th Deck was added too respond to the growing tensions.<br>\
	After the wars, the Strelka was often used to clear out paths for the Marksman fleet."

/obj/item/paper/strelkacommand/pathfinder
	name = "Pathfinder notice"
	desc = "Something about the Pathfinder"
	info = "<center><logo><br>\
	Since this vessel is a Nanotrasen Exploration Vessel, the Pathfinder get access to the bridge.<br>\
	On it, they can use the ballista, charter movement of the vessel, and helm it if they have the right accreditation.<br>\
	The chain of command doesn't change."

/obj/item/paper/pamphlet/strelka
	name = "Welcome to the Strelka"
	desc = "Something about the Strelka"
	info = "Welcome to the NEV Strelka.<br>\
	This ship is one of the oldest of the fleet, predating the Phoron wars by 10 years !<br>\
	A luxury yacht, turned blockade runner, turned pathclearer, and now turned exploration vessel, but most importantly, more than a workplace, your new home.<br>\
	It should be able to carry out far, like it did to its 17 previous crews."

/obj/item/paper/strelkacommand/engineer
	name = "Engineer's note"
	desc = "Something about the engine"
	info = "CAUTION : This layout is limited. If setting up the emitter, please always be available to monitor the supermatter. Unlike the Endeavour, and the Atlas, you can't leave the emiter active without supervision."

// Strelka Objective

/obj/item/paper/strelkaobjective
	name = "NT EXPEDITION ORDER"
	desc = "This important document gives command the crew objectives"
	icon = 'icons/obj/bureaucracy.dmi'
	icon_state = "strelkacommand"

/obj/item/paper/strelkaobjective/one
	info = "<center><logo><br>\
	<center><h1> STRELKA EXPEDITION ORDERS </h1><br>\
	<br>\
	<hr>\
	<br> </center>\
	Greetings Strelka Command, we hope you a good shift.<br>\
	Here are your objectives. They are optional of course, but we will gain alot if you assist with them.<br>\
	They are departement based, and command is tasked to communicate them to the crew, while also helping to achieve them.<br>\
	Okay, so : <br>\
	<br>\
	<hr>\
	<b> CARGO / EXPLORATION / CIVIL MISSION </b> : Expedition teams from the NCS Astral lost a few crates in a lot of POIs arround the sector. <u> We need to recover at least 4. </u><br>\
	<hr>\
	<b> MEDICAL MISSION </b> : We wish to study the effects of the local space on the crews. <u> We ask that you try and get blood samples of members of your crew. </u><br>\
	<hr>\
	<b> SCIENCE MISSION </b> : The last training exercices of the fighter complement on the Astral ended up bad. <u> We request that your crew attempts to build 2 new fighters. </u><br>\
	<hr>\
	<b> SECURITY MISSION </b> : We need to review the defences of the sector. <u> If possible, please review, interview or interogate members of the Militia regarding their defenses. </u><br>\
	<hr>\
	<b> ENGINEERING MISSION </b> : The Roseline Colony Fleet will soon receive the visit of phoronoid diplomates. <u> They request that you use one of the available rooms there to flood it with phoron. Please do not flood the whole vessel.</u><br>\
	<hr>\
	We wish you luck, <hr>\
	<i>Acting Centcom NCS Astral Command</i>."

/obj/item/paper/strelkaobjective/two
	info = "<center><logo><br>\
	<center><h1> STRELKA EXPEDITION ORDERS </h1><br>\
	<br>\
	<hr>\
	<br> </center>\
	Greetings Strelka Command, we hope you a good shift.<br>\
	Here are your objectives. They are optional of course, but we will gain alot if you assist with them.<br>\
	They are departement based, and command is tasked to communicate them to the crew, while also helping to achieve them.<br>\
	Okay, so : <br>\
	<br>\
	<hr>\
	<b> CIVIL MISSION </b> : We are having a few VIP onboard the Astral. Issue is that an assistant deepfried all of the five star course the chef made, and the latter quit. <u> We require a luxurious meal to be made. Without fish, our VIP is allergic. </u><br>\
	<hr>\
	<b> EXPLORATION / MEDICAL / SCIENCE MISSION </b> : We wish to study the effects of the electro storms on the crews. <u> We ask that you try and get blood samples of members of your crew. After flying in a electro storm. </u><br>\
	<hr>\
	<b> SECURITY MISSION </b> : One of the first officer on the Astral managed to scare a IAA when they admitted not having any safety on their gun. Unless you want us all being investigated, <u> we request a qualified personel to host basic gun training for security and command and crew. </u><br>\
	<hr>\
	<b> CARGO MISSION </b> : Corporate wish to evaluate the profit of the area regarding trade and Exploration. <u> We request that you export ores, treasture, and traded goods in order to have at least 8000 trade points. </u><br>\
	<hr>\
	<b> ENGINEERING MISSION </b> : Our fleet will soon past near a sun. To boost the power output, <u> we request that you set at least 6 or more solar panels. </u><br>\
	<hr>\
	We wish you luck, <hr>\
	<i>Acting Centcom NCS Astral Command</i>."


